,{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いつ出てくるだろう?\n中盤戦か? 後半戦かなぁ?...\nドキドキ、わくわく o(・∀・)o』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思う間もなく\nえりかん♪が登場してきて\nRottyわたくし\nたまげたぜぜぜー ぃ(/´▽`)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最高に良かった ! !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わってすぐ えりかん♪に\n「ビブリア見たよ ! !\nめちゃ最高だった★☆★」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と伝えました ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週も楽しみだなぁ〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではん、\nおやすみなさいん＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOSI☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ−より"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/02/11/9471025/0001.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9701":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいつも通り学校でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"廊下寒過ぎるんだがっ！\n体育寒過ぎるんだがっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育の後の授業、\n手がかじかんで上手く字書けない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けても見えないあったかい\n顔面マスクと手袋\n誰か開発してくれないかなー><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前載っけたスケジュール帳！\nどうしちゃったのか。\nついぺたぺた貼ってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでもかんでも\n色をつけたくなるみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー内って年賀状とか\n出したの？それともメール？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時になったとたんみんなで\nあけおめあけおめあけおめって笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントしてるけど\nこれってもうすでに\nまりっ会に入ってる？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まりっ会」正会員の基準って\n何ですか(^o^;)？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気のきいたコメント出来ないし\n他のメンバーを推してるけど\n僕はまりっ会だと思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか推しの方はまりっ会です。\n入会手続きなんて必要ないですよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他推しがいても、まりっかも\n推してくださってるならまりっ会！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正会員...？\nそんなこと考えてなかった。\nんーじゃあまりっか単推しは\n正会員さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...でもそんな設定\nこだわってないのでゆるくね。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今一番好きな髪型って何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪切ったし、ストレートで\n毛先内側にくるんてしたのが\nいいかなー。楽だし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこのブランドの服が好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと変わったかも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちゃちゅむ\nライチ\nbulle de savon\nCHILDWOMAN\nBEAMSBOY\nJOURNAL STANDARD\nfranche lippee\nParAvion\nRNA-N"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A-net系もすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はカジュアルだけどレトロで\nちょっと上品な服にはまってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きというより憧れかなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝どうやって起きてる⁇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータイのアラーム最大音量で笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の抱負は何？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと言ってなかった><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外見も内面も美しくなりたい。\nあと、自分のやりたいことが\nできたらいいな。\nとにかくいろいろなことに挑戦する！\n万理華らしく＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな曲と、映画はなんですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よく聴くのは東京事変、アジカン。\n映画は告白がすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろくまりっくま先輩から\n年賀状届いた?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来なかった...\n冬眠してるんだよ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"矯正したことありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ない><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春の七草は全部言える？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セリ、ナズナ、ゴギョウ、ハコベラ\nホトケノザ、スズナ、スズシロ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...どや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は手荒れがツラいんだけど、\nオススメのケアの方法ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりハンドクリームが\nいいじゃないかな。辛いですよね; ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お年玉は何に使うの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前の買い物で半分\n使ってしまったので...\n半分は貯金してます。\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆\n第２７回\n日本ゴールドディスク大賞で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニュー・アーティスト・オブ・ザ・イヤーの邦楽部門で\n乃木坂46が受賞しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。\n☆☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんにからかわれるっち\nばかにすんなっち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもせいたんらぶたん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今せいたんの携帯おかしいらしく、\nブログの更新ができないみたいです><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はせいたん\nブログ更新されないよー！\nさびしいのお; ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新待ってるぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/09/3176395/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊\n遅くなってしまったけど...\n12月お誕生日の方、\nおめでとうございました！\n＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}}